<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Protection Paladin Tank in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Trial of the Grand Crusader. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h2>Gearing in Wrath of the Lich King is mostly about determining what type of survivability you want to err towards. This is to say that, you could stack copious amounts of hard avoidance in the form of dodge and parry and reduce the amount of times you're hit per fight. You could otherwise try to stack health multipliers like armor and stamina which will give you a larger effective health pool (EHP), but you'll take hits more often. This is just to say that you have multiple avenues of how you want to approach your gearing process, and they all come with different strengths and weaknesses. We try to strike a balance between these methods but also chiefly equip the highest quality gear per slot, meaning we have tried to select the highest return on your investment per item slot for Phase 3 raiding. <br/>
<br/>Occasionally you'll have to wear an item that is ostensibly worse than something else, but is necessary to match set bonus requirements or achieve certain stat caps like crit immunity, hit cap, and the expertise caps. It's then important to remember that your gear in WotLKC will undergo constant change and you might be expected to be able to swap gear to specialize your performance on any given encounter. Because of this, you will have to adapt your sets to continuously meet these necessary criteria. This also means you are encouraged to hold on to gear as long as you can in order to create as big of a bank as possible to draw from.<br/>
<br/>While these are our primary recommendations we provide you with a range of options and alternatives and there are many potential sets that you could build with these items, as we go into the later stages of Wrath of the Lich King, gear is much more homogenized and many of our slots are determined by item level. As such you can build a huge range of specialized sets for different circumstances, the sets we put forth are primarily chosen on a combination of Survivability /<wbr/> DPS /<wbr/> Utility. For more specific situations, you're welcome to speak to us directly at the <a href="https://discord.gg/lightclubclassic" target="_blank">Light Club Discord</a>, or use the same tools that we utilize to determine this gear <a href="https://wowsims.github.io/wotlk/protection_paladin/" target="_blank">Gear and DPS Simulator</a>.<div class="clear"></div>
