<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="protection-paladin-phase-3-best-in-slotrealistic-bis">Protection Paladin - Phase 3 Best In Slot<br/>Realistic BiS</h4>Realistic set is a bit of a misnomer as this includes everything but weapons and tier from 25-man heroic, though we opted to make and present this set primarily because we advise you to pass on heavily contested gear in this tier. So think of this more as the recommended gearing path than what you might <b>want</b> to get, but rather what you <b>should</b> get. Tier 9 is not a very challenging tier for tank survivability, allowing the group to deprioritize tanks and healers in favor of DPS for much of the content phase. This set was not made with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=28878/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> in mind, if you have access to a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_draenei_female.gif");'></span> in your party, we suggest you opt for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64579/enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a>.<br/>
