<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>We recommend that you pass the tier token and go for one of the emblem shoulders instead. While <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48647/liadrins-shoulderguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Liadrin's Shoulderguards of Triumph</span></a> is relatively the best shoulder piece, we have a wide selection of very accessible items in this phase. If you can access trophies then you should opt for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48661/liadrins-shoulderguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Liadrin's Shoulderguards of Triumph</span></a> in order to get your 2-set, though while it's a very minor upgrade (50 dps), all 245 item level shoulders are very close in power and should you acquire either before you can afford these, you should hold off until you are swimming in emblems or trophies. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48016/sunreaver-defenders-pauldrons">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Defender's Pauldrons</span></a> has an interesting, uncommon stat spread, but SBV and an extra socket makes this pretty competitive.<div class="box">
<b>Shoulder Enchants</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44957/greater-inscription-of-the-gladiator">
