<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47415/hauberk-of-the-towering-monstrosity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hauberk of the Towering Monstrosity</span></a> is the best tanking chest this phase, though being able to option into <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48651/liadrins-breastplate-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Liadrin's Breastplate of Triumph</span></a> is down to tier token availability to you. The former has better stats, since neither set bonus is particularly good we can safely say go for off-set on this slot.<br/>
<br/>The rest of the chests are more or less the same with slight deviations, trading stam/<wbr/>dodge/<wbr/>parry for one or the other, though no one does this at any outrageous rate to make them stand out as highly specialized. The only real stand outs are; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47592/breastplate-of-the-white-knight">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breastplate of the White Knight</span></a> for the fact that it's BoE making it very easy to equip a very good chest this tier, should nothing ever drop, or if you primarily do 10-man normals.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47449/chestplate-of-the-frostwolf-hero">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestplate of the Frostwolf Hero</span></a> is an interesting item that may give you a very solid hit boost at BiS. It has the perfect stat exchange that we want, in it that it gives us a lot of hit and strength while also maintaining a lot of stamina. Interesting DPS choice for down the line.<div class="box">
<b>Chest Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47900/enchant-chest-super-health">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Super Health</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60692/enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Powerful Stats</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47766/enchant-chest-greater-defense">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Greater Defense</span></a></div>
