<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>Choice in wrist hinges more on what weapon you have access to more than anything else. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47459/armguards-of-the-shieldmaiden">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armguards of the Shieldmaiden</span></a> are the best phase 3 wrists, though if you're using a weapon without hit rating such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46097/caress-of-insanity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caress of Insanity</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47528/cudgel-of-the-damned">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_101.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cudgel of the Damned</span></a>, opting into any of the hit options is probably going to benefit you more.<div class="box">
<b>Wrist Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62256/enchant-bracers-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Major Stamina</span></a>. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=164/blacksmithing">Blacksmiths</a> can also attach <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_thoriumsetting.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a> to their wrists. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">Leatherworkers</a> can also apply resistance enchants which are particularly powerful in this phase such as <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57699/fur-lining-nature-resist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Nature Resist</span></a>.</div>
