<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>Most glove upgrades in phase 3 are pretty similar, your choice mostly boils down to access to tier tokens and sockets. The 2-set for this tier is not worth taking a valuable heroic 25-man token from a DPS if you already have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45487/handguards-of-revitalization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handguards of Revitalization</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>A choice you might get to make at the tail end of this phase is if you want to pick up a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48618/liadrins-gauntlets-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_65.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Liadrin's Gauntlets of Triumph</span></a>, this is a great pair of gloves that mirror the benefits of other hit oriented plate DPS gear that we might equip in other slots.<div class="box">
<b>Glove Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63770/reticulated-armor-webbing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reticulated Armor Webbing</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44625/enchant-gloves-armsman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Armsman</span></a>. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=164/blacksmithing">Blacksmiths</a> also attach <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55641/socket-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Gloves</span></a> to their gloves.</div>
