<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>Not unlike phase 2 hit is extremely abundant for us while gearing, though once we start approaching BiS we have to be significantly more selective with our decisions around gemming, consuming (and gearing) in order to maintain our hit cap. For that reason, while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47434/legplates-of-feverish-dedication">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of Feverish Dedication</span></a> have better stats on the surface, the conditions that we find ourselves in as our sets progress makes <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48648/liadrins-legguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Liadrin's Legguards of Triumph</span></a> a very balanced and worthwhile investment. This is also a phase where we lose a significant amount of block value through upgrades, this is especially true if you ran 4-set in phase 2, that paired with the loss of the libram makes existing block value weigh higher as we are no longer prone to over-capping SBV for damage.<br/>
<br/>Likewise as above <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45594/legplates-of-the-endless-void">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of the Endless Void</span></a> are excellent phase 2 legs, you could go all of phase 3 without upgrading out of these and you wouldn't even feel bad about it, but they just lag behind as hit becomes scarce.<div class="box">
<b>Leg Enchants</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38373/frosthide-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frosthide Leg Armor</span></a>. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">Leatherworkers</a> can make their own <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60583/jormungar-leg-reinforcements">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jormungar Leg Reinforcements</span></a>.</div>
