<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-protection-paladin-tank-phase-1">Neck for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 1</h4>There's not much to say about necks, item-level sorta dominate this item slot and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47466/legionnaires-gorget">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legionnaire's Gorget</span></a> will fit very well into your balanced and high survivability sets. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45485/bronze-pendant-of-the-vanir">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bronze Pendant of the Vanir</span></a> is still a good item, you're not exactly in a rush to upgrade from this either.<br/>
<br/>The block necks in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45262/necklace-of-unerring-mettle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Unerring Mettle</span></a> &amp; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44665/nexus-war-champion-beads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nexus War Champion Beads</span></a> bear mentioning. While not as good as thought to be, blocking the adds on heroic 25m <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34564/anubarak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a> is still strong and should be considered as a tech option for this fight.<div class="pad"></div>
