<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>Weapons in Phase 3 are not as critical for our performance as they were in the previous phases, the upgrade from 245 to 258 in the weapon slot while good is not close to how much your other raid members will get from their upgrades.<br/>
<br/>It means that weapon choice in phase 3 is primarily informed by availability and how contested the loot is for your groups. That is to say that while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47475/hellscream-slicer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellscream Slicer</span></a> is the highest performing weapon in phase 3 for most Protection Paladins, we don't readily advise you to jump on the opportunity to pick it up. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47526/remorseless">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_105.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Remorseless</span></a> is a competitive weapon, primarily for Alliance and will exceed matching the axe in function as long as you hit cap through other means. Both these weapons offer significantly better returns in the hands of the DPS players who get about twice as much DPS from them, than Protection Paladins.<br/>
<br/>The reason we put the axe up higher is because it is much easier to just equip and play with it, most protection paladins will be leaving Ulduar with Serilas, both having hit on them makes it an easy trade without any great adjustments to how you have previously geared or gemmed. This makes the mace harder to recommend right off the bat, because unless you are prepared to adjust any of the above, it will likely not be an upgrade for you until you are closer to full BiS.<br/>
<br/>The phase 2 options are however very easy to acquire in this phase, being purchasable through the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a>. As such <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46097/caress-of-insanity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caress of Insanity</span></a> &amp; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45947/serilas-blood-blade-of-invar-one-arm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Serilas, Blood Blade of Invar One-Arm</span></a> remain very strong and viable throughout this entire tier.<div class="box">
<b>Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64579/enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59619/enchant-weapon-accuracy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Accuracy</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=27984/enchant-weapon-mongoose">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mongoose</span></a> &gt; <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41976/titanium-weapon-chain">
