<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="librams">Librams for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="librams">Librams for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 3</h3>This is the first phase where we actually might pay attention to which libram to use. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45145/libram-of-the-sacred-shield">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofhope.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of the Sacred Shield</span></a> remains a strong libram with solid DPS and mitigative properties. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47664/libram-of-defiance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofhope.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of Defiance</span></a> is likewise very good, the use-case distinction is less about what's better for you, but rather a consideration on healer mana in a given encounter. The latter will reduce your DTPS by a greater degree, though the former is better for your mitigation. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47661/libram-of-valiance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofhope.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of Valiance</span></a> comes in a little out of left field, while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45145/libram-of-the-sacred-shield">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofhope.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of the Sacred Shield</span></a> was mitigation with damage, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47661/libram-of-valiance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofhope.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of Valiance</span></a> is damage with mitigation and the amount of strength you get from this is very premium.<div class="pad"></div>
